# Frontend build-time configuration.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` for local overrides. Everything here is PUBLIC — Vite
# inlines VITE_* variables into the JavaScript bundle. Never put a secret in
# this file or in the hosting provider's frontend environment.

# Public origin of the Recourse backend.
#
# Leave UNSET for local development: the Vite dev server proxies "/api" to
# http://localhost:3001, so the browser sees a single origin.
#
# REQUIRED for a deployed build (Vercel etc.). Without it the built app calls
# "/api/..." on the static host, which has no backend, and every request 404s.
#
# No trailing slash.
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.up.railway.app
